---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import devshopLogo from '../../assets/screenshots/devshop logo.png';
---

<section class="devshop-teaser section" aria-labelledby="devshop-teaser-h">
  <div class="container devshop-teaser__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Latest</p>
    <a href="/devshop" class="devshop-teaser__logo-link" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 20ms">
      <Image
        class="devshop-teaser__logo"
        src={devshopLogo}
        width={devshopLogo.width}
        height={devshopLogo.height}
        alt="DevShop — built fast, for real businesses"
      />
    </a>
    <h2
      id="devshop-teaser-h"
      class="devshop-teaser__h"
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 60ms"
    >
      Every build below started with me, by hand. This one doesn't need me.
    </h2>
    <div class="devshop-teaser__prose measure" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
      <p>
        Travaholic, the villas platform, the gallery — each of the products
        further down this page began the same way: someone described a real
        problem, and I built the answer myself, one engagement at a time.
        That works. It doesn't scale, and scale was never really the
        interesting part to me anyway.
      </p>
      <p>
        So I built the version that removes the wait. Describe the actual
        problem your business has, and it hands back a working demo on the
        spot — not a deck, not a callback next week.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="devshop-teaser__cta" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
      <a class="link-underline" href="/devshop">Describe a problem, get a demo →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .devshop-teaser__inner {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .devshop-teaser__logo-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -18px rgba(26, 20, 16, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .devshop-teaser__logo-link:hover,
  .devshop-teaser__logo-link:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .devshop-teaser__logo {
    display: block;
    height: 3.25rem;
    width: auto;
  }
  .devshop-teaser__h {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .devshop-teaser__prose p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .devshop-teaser__prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .devshop-teaser__cta {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 1.6rem);
  }
</style>
